| TV-LIVE-05 | `mode = live`, all gates pass, `live_gate_state` last evaluated `> ready_window_ms` ago | block | `live_gate_state_stale` |
| TV-LIVE-06 | `mode = live`, all gates pass, fresh, kill switch armed, human + token | allow | — |

